                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]General[/h1] \n\nGlitchbuster is a fun little game that'll keep you on your toes with the glitches thrown at you in levels. The right powerups for me were Shockwave accompanied by either Double Jump or More Powerful Powerups. This game could use a Survival mode ;)\n\n[b]Pros:[/b]\n[list]\n[*] Variety of glitches to have fun with in the level\n[*] Lots of power-up combinations to explore within levels\n[*] Glitch effects while playing\n[/list]\n\n[b]Cons:[/b]\n[list]\n[*] Shortsighted glitch, y doe?\n[/list]",
